    question: 'How do I know when to upgrade my hosting?',
    answer: '<p>Signs you\'ve outgrown your current hosting:</p><ul><li><strong>Slow load times:</strong> Pages take more than 3 seconds</li><li><strong>Frequent downtime:</strong> More than a few hours per month</li><li><strong>Resource limits:</strong> Hitting CPU, RAM, or storage caps</li><li><strong>Traffic spikes crash your site:</strong> Can\'t handle promotional periods</li><li><strong>Security incidents:</strong> Hacks or vulnerabilities</li></ul><p>If you\'re experiencing any of these, it\'s time to upgrade. Don\'t wait for a critical failure during a product launch or important campaign.</p>'
  }
