  <!-- A2 Hosting -->
  <h3 id="a2hosting">6. A2 Hosting — Best for Speed at Low Prices</h3>
  <p>
    A2 Hosting emphasizes speed with their "Turbo" servers that promise up to 20x faster page loads. They offer a good
    balance of performance and affordable pricing.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>What makes A2 Hosting stand out:</strong> Turbo servers with LiteSpeed technology deliver genuinely faster
    performance than typical shared hosting. The "anytime" money-back guarantee removes risk.
  </p>
  <p>
    <strong>Key features:</strong>
  </p>
